<file path="README.md">
# 🎓 CampusJugaad

A student marketplace where college students can buy, sell, rent, and borrow items like books, electronics, furniture, and more — all within their campus community.

## 🔗 Live Links
- **Website**: https://campusjugaad.vercel.app
- **Backend API**: https://campusjugaad-server.onrender.com
- **GitHub**: https://github.com/RAVIKUMAR-code171/campusbazaar

## ✨ Features

### Core Marketplace
- Buy, sell, and rent items between students
- Browse by category (Books, Electronics, Furniture, Transport, Stationery, Notes, Hostel Items, Calculators)
- Advanced search with price range and college filters
- Image upload via Cloudinary
- Listing detail page with seller contact info

### Authentication
- Email/password registration with OTP verification
- Google OAuth login
- JWT-based session management

### Community Features
- Post and respond to item requests
- Real-time chat between buyers and sellers (Socket.io)
- Wishlist to save favorite items
- Reviews and ratings system
- Notifications system with unread count

### AI-Powered Features
- AI Listing Generator — auto-generates titles and descriptions
- AI Chatbot Assistant — answers student questions about the platform

### Payments
- Razorpay integration for secure transactions (test mode)

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

**Frontend**
- React + Vite
- React Router
- Axios
- React Hot Toast
- Socket.io Client

**Backend**
- Node.js + Express
- MongoDB + Mongoose
- Socket.io
- JWT Authentication
- Passport.js (Google OAuth)
- Cloudinary (image storage)
- Resend (transactional email)
- Razorpay (payments)
- Anthropic Claude API (AI features)

**Deployment**
- Frontend: Vercel
- Backend: Render
- Database: MongoDB Atlas

## 📁 Project Structure
